<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">Agentic Scene Policies:
<br class="ltx_break">Unifying Space, Semantics, and Affordances for Robot Action
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><a href="https://sachamorin.github.io/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="--ltx-fg-color:#491EB3;">Sacha Morin</a>
